  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Pu & =[\\begin{aligned}m & n & -m \\\\ m & -n & -m \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ p \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}m\\cdot 1 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,n\\cdot p & + & (-m)\\cdot 1 \\\\ m\\cdot 1 & + & (-n)\\cdot p & + & (-m)\\cdot 1 \\\\ 0\\cdot 1 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\cdot p & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\cdot 1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}m & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,np & + & (-m) \\\\ m & + & (-np) & + & (-m) \\\\ 0 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2p & + & 0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}np \\\\ -np \\\\ 2p\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
